<title>CANADA: Scott's Restaurants reports 22-week loss.</title>
<headline>Scott's Restaurants reports 22-week loss.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	C$0.19   profit	C$0.05</p>
<p> Net	   loss	 5,700   profit	 1,500</p>
<p> Revs		     151,400		  150,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Scott's Restaurants Inc.</p>
<p>As a result of company consolidation, 1996 figures are based on a 22-week reporting period, while 1995 figures are based on a 21-week reporting period.</p>
<p>1996 results are for period ended December 28. 1995 period ended December 23.</p>
<p>Loss for 1996 included a C$18 million restructuring charge recorded in October as a result of a review of costs and assets following consolidation of the company.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416-941-8100))</p>
</text>
